#: includes/classes/Core/Controllers/RestAPI/V2/Booking.php:1393
msgid "Badges marking how the booking came about or has changed since, e.g. `Manual` or `Modified`, in display order. The same list the Bookings list shows; add-ons append through `wptravelengine_booking_state_badges`."
msgstr ""

